+## Contract notes
 
-## Requirements
+- **No admin.** The Staker has no owner, no pause and no upgrade path. Only a depositor can move
+  their own position.
+- **Deposits are credited by measured balance delta**, not by the requested amount. USDC takes no
+  transfer fee today, but it is an upgradeable proxy, and over-crediting would leave the last
+  users unable to withdraw.
+- **`SafeERC20` everywhere**, so a non-standard return value from a future USDC implementation
+  reverts rather than silently succeeding.
+- Approvals from the UI are for the **exact amount being staked**, so no allowance is left sitting
+  on the vault afterwards. That means staking is two transactions each time.
 
